# Optional. Copy to .env.local. Nothing here is a secret: Vite exposes VITE_* values to the browser.
# URL of a form-handling endpoint (Formspree, Getform, your own API...). When empty the forms run in clearly labelled DEMO mode.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
# Public site URL used by the SEO generator (sitemap/robots) and canonical tags. Overrides src/config/site.ts. Set it in the shell when building (VITE_SITE_URL=https://… npm run build) so the sitemap and canonical tags agree.
VITE_SITE_URL=
